WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:32.416
In this third verse of Chapter 16, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.333
completes His list of

3
00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.750
twenty-six divine qualities.

4
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.458
Here He particularly

5
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:41.541
highlights those qualities that provide

6
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.333
inner strength and moral clarity.

7
00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:48.375
These are the very qualities that enable the soul

8
00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:52.833
not only to act with maturity in worldly life,

9
00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:57.125
but also gradually elevate
the consciousness higher, 

10
00:00:57.125 --> 00:01:00.458
toward spiritual realisation.

11
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.041
Tejah means

12
00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:09.458
inner strength and radiance.

13
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:12.333
Tej does not mean aggression.

14
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:15.958
It is the radiance born of righteous conduct,

15
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:17.416
which gives a person the courage

16
00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:21.541
to be decisive and to take responsibility.

17
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:24.541
Such a person does not shrink
from difficulty, but

18
00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:28.708
steps forward to fulfil their duty.

19
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:29.750
Kshama

20
00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.625
means forgiveness.

21
00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:36.291
Forgiveness means letting go of bitterness.

22
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:40.000
It is the active decision not to seek revenge,

23
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.750
even when the power to retaliate

24
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.791
lies with you.

25
00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:47.125
It arises from the understanding

26
00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:51.000
that everyone is learning and
can make mistakes.

27
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.041
Forgiveness protects compassion
from bitterness.

28
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:59.125
Dhritih – patience and fortitude.

29
00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:00.666
Dhritih means

30
00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:02.708
inner strength,

31
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:05.291
remaining steady even in adversity.

32
00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.375
Such a person, even when adverse
circumstances come,

33
00:02:08.375 --> 00:02:09.625
does not abandon their

34
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:12.458
practice or moral values.

35
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:14.041
They are emotionally

36
00:02:14.041 --> 00:02:18.250
firm and unwavering in their resolve.

37
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:23.000
Shaucham – inner and outer purity.

38
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.250
Shaucha is not only physical cleanliness.

39
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.500
It is the purity of thoughts,

40
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.833
intentions, and conduct.

41
00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:34.000
It includes avoiding deceit and maintaining

42
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.083
a sattvic environment within and without.

43
00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:42.625
Adrohah – absence of malice.

44
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.208
Droha means

45
00:02:44.208 --> 00:02:47.875
causing harm to others, whether openly

46
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:48.833
or covertly,

47
00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:50.208
and it usually

48
00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:53.333
arises from envy or revenge.

49
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.750
Adroha means

50
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.541
the complete absence of this tendency.

51
00:02:57.541 --> 00:03:00.291
Such a person holds no grudge, nor

52
00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:04.250
harbours any desire to bring others down.

53
00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.583
Natimanita means

54
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.750
freedom from the craving for honour.

55
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.708
Atimanita means an intense craving

56
00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:16.041
for respect and praise.

57
00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:20.625
Natimanita means the absence of that craving.

58
00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:23.833
Such a person is content in their duty.

59
00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:24.791
When praise comes,

60
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:27.000
they accept it with humility,

61
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:31.875
but their self-worth does not depend on praise.

62
00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:34.416
Lord Krishna explains that all these qualities

63
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:36.000
are the daivi sampat –

64
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.875
the inner wealth of spiritual progress.

65
00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:41.666
These are not merely conduct,

66
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:45.125
but expressions of pure consciousness.

67
00:03:45.125 --> 00:03:47.708
He also acknowledges that in some people

68
00:03:47.708 --> 00:03:50.458
these qualities appear naturally,

69
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:52.583
due to past sanskaras.

70
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:56.625
But every seeker, if they wish,
through practice, good company,

71
00:03:56.625 --> 00:04:00.541
and self-reflection, can develop them.

72
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:07.375
Life does not always

73
00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:10.375
move according to your plans.

74
00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:13.291
Sometimes a moment comes

75
00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:16.000
when the mind says,

76
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.833
‘This is very hard,’ or

77
00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:21.666
‘What does this mean?’

78
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:25.166
This is exactly when you

79
00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:29.083
need dhritih.

80
00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:30.583
That strength

81
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:34.666
which gives the courage to keep going.

82
00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.583
I have said,

83
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:39.791
this quality is divine.

84
00:04:39.791 --> 00:04:44.583
Dhritih is not a loud strength.

85
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:46.750
It is the calm

86
00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.833
and steady power within.

87
00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:52.750
It is the decision

88
00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:56.083
that ‘I will keep moving forward,’

89
00:04:56.083 --> 00:04:59.041
even if anyone watches or not,

90
00:04:59.041 --> 00:05:01.375
appreciates or not.

91
00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:03.750
I will simply keep walking.

92
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:07.166
When practice feels dull,

93
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:11.958
when relationships test your patience,

94
00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:15.541
or when results do not show

95
00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:19.750
despite effort – do not give up.

96
00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.125
Hold your ground.

97
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:25.000
Keep walking.

98
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.500
Even if the steps are small, if the direction

99
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.541
is right, they are invaluable.

100
00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:35.500
It is not necessary for you to feel

101
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.666
motivated every moment.

102
00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:40.791
You only need to keep walking

103
00:05:40.791 --> 00:05:45.583
in the right spirit and the right direction.

104
00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.916
When you stand firm in your values, in truth,

105
00:05:48.916 --> 00:05:53.625
and in your connection with Me,

106
00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:58.208
your inner foundation becomes unshakeable.

107
00:05:58.208 --> 00:06:00.541
This is dhritih.

108
00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:05.000
And with every step on that path,

109
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.166
I walk alongside you.

110
00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:08.875
Blessings.

111
00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:15.958
In close relationships,

112
00:06:15.958 --> 00:06:18.958
feelings run deep.

113
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:24.125
Sometimes a single word, a behaviour, or even

114
00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:28.208
silence can wound the heart.

115
00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:30.500
Adroha –

116
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.208
the absence of the tendency

117
00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:37.208
to harm someone –

118
00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:39.291
and kshama –

119
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:41.833
the power to forgive –

120
00:06:41.833 --> 00:06:44.375
are signs of divine strength.

121
00:06:44.375 --> 00:06:45.583
When you

122
00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:49.750
hold on to small grievances,

123
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:54.041
you carry a heavy burden.

124
00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:57.291
This does not only block your love,

125
00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:01.208
it also obstructs the flow of My grace

126
00:07:01.208 --> 00:07:04.833
from coming into your home.

127
00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:07.041
Forgiveness does not mean

128
00:07:07.041 --> 00:07:09.458
forgetting what happened.

129
00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:12.125
It means not letting that pain

130
00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:16.666
harden your heart.

131
00:07:16.666 --> 00:07:18.333
Sometimes

132
00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:20.625
those you love

133
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:22.791
will disappoint you.

134
00:07:22.791 --> 00:07:26.291
They may never ask for forgiveness.

135
00:07:26.291 --> 00:07:28.500
They may not even know

136
00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.416
that they have hurt you.

137
00:07:31.416 --> 00:07:34.791
Yet, instead of the poison of unrest,

138
00:07:34.791 --> 00:07:37.833
you can choose peace.

139
00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:39.250
Let go.

140
00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.541
Not because they deserve it,

141
00:07:42.541 --> 00:07:45.000
but

142
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:50.833
because you deserve peace.

143
00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:52.750
Give up the need

144
00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:56.333
for retaliation, for revenge.

145
00:07:56.333 --> 00:07:58.416
Even in its smallest forms,

146
00:07:58.416 --> 00:08:01.333
hold no grievance.

147
00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:04.666
When you forgive with gentleness

148
00:08:04.666 --> 00:08:08.583
and release the bitterness within,

149
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:11.625
your heart becomes pure.

150
00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:18.333
And near such a heart, I am always present.

151
00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:20.750
Constant forgiveness

152
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:25.500
brings you ever closer and closer to Me.

153
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.708
Reflect on this.

154
00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:34.416
At the workplace, it is natural for you

155
00:08:34.416 --> 00:08:38.750
to want your efforts to be seen.

156
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.833
But

157
00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:43.208
the divine person

158
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:47.500
adopts natimanita, that is,

159
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.875
freedom from the craving for honour.

160
00:08:50.875 --> 00:08:53.500
Wanting appreciation is human,

161
00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.833
but placing the value of your worth

162
00:08:56.833 --> 00:09:00.958
only on praise –

163
00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:04.083
this is where the problem begins.

164
00:09:04.083 --> 00:09:05.625
When your happiness

165
00:09:05.625 --> 00:09:09.333
depends on the praise of others,

166
00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:14.125
its absence makes you restless.

167
00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:18.625
And when it goes to someone else,

168
00:09:18.625 --> 00:09:21.333
you become unsettled.

169
00:09:21.333 --> 00:09:23.666
Slowly, attention shifts from

170
00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:28.166
doing your best work,

171
00:09:28.166 --> 00:09:32.375
to who is noticing you.

172
00:09:32.375 --> 00:09:34.791
But

173
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:37.541
when you give up this craving

174
00:09:37.541 --> 00:09:42.375
and fulfil your duty only with sincerity,

175
00:09:42.375 --> 00:09:45.291
a lightness comes within.

176
00:09:45.291 --> 00:09:48.458
Then you do not perform to gain recognition,

177
00:09:48.458 --> 00:09:51.666
but work from a depth of purpose

178
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:55.250
and peace.

179
00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.166
Whether recognition comes or not,

180
00:09:58.166 --> 00:10:01.625
contentment always comes.

181
00:10:01.625 --> 00:10:03.208
At your workplace,

182
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:06.500
work with complete integrity.

183
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:10.166
If praise comes, accept it with humility.

184
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:13.166
And if silence or indifference comes,

185
00:10:13.166 --> 00:10:14.375
accept that too

186
00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:17.583
with the same humility.

187
00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:21.666
When you do not run after honour,

188
00:10:21.666 --> 00:10:26.750
then your professional life
becomes more genuine.

189
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.375
And then your very presence itself

190
00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:35.333
begins to speak louder than any award.

191
00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:36.208
Reflect on this.
